@startuml Payment_Management_Flow
title Manage Payments (UC#7) — Analysis View

actor Traveler
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Backend" as Backend
participant "Payment Gateway" as Stripe
participant "Database" as DB

== Pay for a Booking ==

Traveler -> App: Request to pay for booking
activate App

App -> Backend: Initiate payment
activate Backend

alt Payment gateway available
  Backend -> Stripe: Create payment session
  activate Stripe
  Stripe --> Backend: Payment session created
  deactivate Stripe

  Backend --> App: Ready for payment
  deactivate Backend

  App --> Traveler: Complete payment securely
  deactivate App

  Traveler -> Stripe: Submit payment details
  activate Stripe

  alt Payment successful
    Stripe --> Traveler: Payment succeeded
    deactivate Stripe

    Traveler -> App: Confirm payment
    activate App
    App -> Backend: Confirm and verify payment
    activate Backend

    Backend -> Stripe: Verify payment status
    activate Stripe
    Stripe --> Backend: Payment verified
    deactivate Stripe

    Backend -> DB: Update booking and\ntrip status
    activate DB
    DB --> Backend: Status updated
    deactivate DB

    Backend --> App: Booking confirmed\nwith receipt
    deactivate Backend
    App --> Traveler: Booking confirmed
    deactivate App

  else Payment failed
    Stripe --> Traveler: Payment failed
    deactivate Stripe

    Traveler -> App: Retry payment
    activate App
    App -> Backend: Initiate payment again
    activate Backend
    Backend --> App: New payment session
    deactivate Backend
    App --> Traveler: Retry checkout
    deactivate App
  end

else Payment gateway unavailable
  Backend --> App: Simulated payment mode
  deactivate Backend

  App --> Traveler: Payment simulated\n(test environment)
  deactivate App

  App -> Backend: Confirm payment
  activate Backend
  Backend -> DB: Confirm booking
  activate DB
  DB --> Backend: Booking confirmed
  deactivate DB
  Backend --> App: Booking confirmed
  deactivate Backend
  App --> Traveler: Booking confirmed
  deactivate App
end

== Pay All Pending Bookings ==

Traveler -> App: Pay all pending bookings
activate App

App -> Backend: Pay all bookings for trip
activate Backend

Backend -> Stripe: Create payment for\ntotal amount
activate Stripe
Stripe --> Backend: Payment created
deactivate Stripe

Backend -> DB: Confirm all bookings
activate DB
DB --> Backend: All bookings confirmed
deactivate DB

Backend --> App: All payments processed
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: Trip fully confirmed
deactivate App

@enduml
